  "details": "Currently, Vive Focus users get labeled as Quest users. This is not a huge problem since almost no one uses a Vive Focus.\nHowever, if VRChat ever comes to the Pico Neo storefront, it will most likely label them as Quest users as well. \nIt is probably a good idea to move away from Facebook-centric labels for Standalone players.\n\nAn alternative could be something like \"Mobile\", \"Standalone\", or \"Android\"",
